        Cl:35.453, K:39.098, Ca:40.078, Sc:44.956, Ti:47.867, V:50.942, Cr:51.996, Mn:54.938,
        Fe:55.845, Co:58.933, Ni:58.693, Cu:63.546, Zn:65.380, Ga:69.723, Ge:72.640, As:74.922,
